# ── Official BSSC/BPSC exam scans (≈143 MB) ────────────────────
# Source booklets + model-answer pages downloaded from bssc.bihar.gov.in. They are public
# government works and re-downloadable (see skills/bssc-test-prep/SKILL.md §10 for the URLs —
# note the JE files are uppercase .PDF; lowercase 404s). What we actually need from them — the
# extracted questions, the hand-transcribed keys and the page maps — is the JSON, which IS tracked.
question_bank_engine/drop/bssc/*.pdf
question_bank_engine/drop/bssc/*.PDF
question_bank_engine/drop/bssc_official/*.pdf

# Generated kids worksheets — a daily build artifact (PDF/HTML/JSON per child per day),
